  "description": "XOGVAQ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H72 O8 Yb4,C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1C (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.614-3.632 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.59-99.73°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H72O8Yb4·C4H8O. Article name explicitly identifies I(I).",
